OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland closure 'big loss' for
OL,4,Aformer mining town
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the former mining town of Camborne,
OL,7,Fthe prospect of losing its branch of
OL,8,FPoundland is a big worry for shoppers
OL,9,Fand workers alike.
OL,11,FThe discount retailer collapsed into
OL,12,Fadministration on Wednesday after its
OL,13,Fowners failed to secure a deal to keep
OL,14,Fit in business, but it will continue to
OL,15,Ftrade while administrators seek to sell
OL,16,Fit and its assets.
OL,18,FMichael Martin, who works at the
OL,19,FCamborne branch, said the shop's
OL,20,Fclosure would "leave this community
OL,21,Fbroken".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
