OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland closure 'big loss' for
OL,4,Aformer mining town
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are two old people's flats near
OL,7,Fus, one behind and one beside, and many
OL,8,Fof them can't walk much further than
OL,9,Fhere, so we see them daily and
OL,10,Fsometimes we are the only people they
OL,11,Fdo see and talk to each day," he said.
